{"text": "Subject FW: EM3 - Resume and Full Bio\nTo \"Maurice Classen\" <Maurice.Classen@cityofchicago.org>\nDate November 16, 2020 at 9:36:53 AM CST\n\nMaurice,\n| wanted to pass along the bio and resume of my distinguished colleague, Edward McDonald. As you will find from his bio and\nresume, Ed is an experienced professional with over 25 years of risk management experience in the public and private sectors. |\nhave discussed the role with Ed and he is very interested in learning more. Ed has family in the Chicagoland area and is very\ninterested in the role of Chief Risk Officer.\n\nPlease let me know if you would like for me to assist with the coordinate a call\n\nTamika Puckett\nChief Risk Officer\nc 312.720.6247\n\nFrom: EM3 <edward.k.mcdonald@gmail.com>\nSent: Friday, October 16, 2020 10:57 AM\nTo: Tamika Puckett <Tamika.Puckett@cityofchicago.org>\nSubject: Re: EM3 - Resume and Full Bio\n\nMuch appreciated\nBe magnificent,\nEdward K. McDonald III, MSc, BBA, RIMS-CRMP, C.M., A.C.E.\n\nSpeaker xx Writer + Strategist x Business Psychologist & Coach\n216.287.1653\n330.536.3828\nSemper Fi!\n(Sent by mobile device. Please excuse any errors or omissions.)\n\nOn Fri, Oct 16, 2020, 9:54 AM Tamika Puckett <Tamika.Puckett@cityofchicago.org> wrote:\n\nHey Ed!\nNo worries at all. | know how it is. | will pass your resume along to the Mayor, Chief of Staff and Mayor\u2019s Counsel.\nI'll let you know of any feedback.\n\nTamika Puckett\nChief Risk Officer\nc 312.720.6247\n\nFrom: EM3 <edward.k.mcdonald@gmail.com>\nSent: Thursday, October 15, 2020 9:58 PM\nTo: Tamika Puckett <Tamika.Puckett@cityofchicago.org>\nCc: burgospuckett@gmail.com\nSubject: EM3 - Resume and Full Bio\n\nHey Tamika,\nSorry for the delay. I passed out asleep when I got home because this week has been so long. I have a presentation to\ngive to the Exec Team in the morning. So glad it's Friday.\nI attached my resume and full bio. Feel free to pass it along. I welcome any dialogue with the City Leadership.\nTappreciate you!\nBe magnificent!\n\nEdward K. McDonald III, MSc, BBA, RIMS-CRMP, C.M., A.C.E.\nThe Neuroscience of ERM & HR Guy | Putting HUMAN back in BEING\nMotivational Speaker *: Writer x: Coach +: Business Psychologist & Strategist x Entrepreneur *< Investor\nOffice: 330-826-1477 | Cell: 216-287-1653\nCleveland x: Portland + Nashville\n\na Edward K. McDonald III\nabout.me/edwardkmcdonald3",
